#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
daily_brief.py — deterministic regeneration of today.md and MANIFEST.md.

Replaces the prose "Claude reads everything and computes" step from P-001 with
a deterministic compute step. Claude (or any model) is still free to ADD
editorial framing on top of the computed sections — but the numbers are fixed
here so they never disagree between today.md and MANIFEST.md.

Usage:
    python3 daily_brief.py                    # write both files for today
    python3 daily_brief.py --date 2026-05-15  # override "today"
    python3 daily_brief.py --dry-run          # print to stdout, do not write
    python3 daily_brief.py --json             # emit machine-readable report
"""
